{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52182","headline":"颂六十二首 七 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令月建清斋，佳辰召无强（一作「疆」）。\n四部依时集，七衆会陞堂。\n萧条清梵举，哀宛（一作「怨」）动宫商。\n香气腾空上，乘风散遐方。\n叹德研冲邃，词辩畅玄芳。\n折烦呈妙句，临时拆婉章。\n缁素相依托，财法发神光。\n神田今夕满，恩慧（一作「惠」）导存亡。\n（见同书卷五《受请部》。\n注一作者爲《法苑珠林》卷一百九之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52182.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52182","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}